<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod falls 0.5 pct yr/yr in Oct.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod falls 0.5 pct yr/yr in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production fell 0.5 percent year-on-year in October, while month-on-month it fell 1.8 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					  Oct 96	Sept 95	Oct 95</p>
<p>General Index			 103.6	 105.5	   104.1</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	   -0.5	  +7.3</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	   -1.8	  +42.9</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months	     +2.1	  +2.8</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
